d-7875d1c5f1b64b47\",\"cmd-eb9ad1332deb4579\",\"cmd-20e12cf709f6418f\",\"cmd-7f2ef4b9142a4fae\",\"cmd-62dc627aecd241bb\"]},{\"id\":\"req-4\",\"requirement\":\"Provider-wide node-restart evidence protocol executed on all three managed nodes (pre-restart baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered service/data/cluster state)\",\"status\":\"satisfied\",\"summary\":\"node2: baseline boot_id 54bd1c3e... and healthy DNS (cmd-642377955a6d4b33), reboot ack (cmd-26d1371e93d841bc), new boot_id 7b89ce38... (cmd-803f90ae1b5c4fa9), recovered resolv.conf/DNS (cmd-7f2ef4b9142a4fae). node3: baseline boot_id 4a743885... (cmd-fe2cba7a775e4310), reboot ack (cmd-8b5d20e8227e4f50), new boot_id c4ea5ab5... (cmd-cfb0674534ff448f), recovery (cmd-62dc627aecd241bb). node1: baseline kern.boottime 16:24:15 (cmd-edcc2f4f617645f6), reboot ack (cmd-883186d843374f1a), new kern.boottime 16:29:08 (cmd-61e5d604217f4a8a), unbound process restarted with DNSBL intact (cmd-591246e0a62b4bbb). End-to-end client verification from node2/node3 after node1's own restart confirms full cluster recovery (cmd-4b8c844dbe934ca9, cmd-32559770f20a49c0). The fixed after_executor snapshot boot-identity values for all three nodes match these executor-observed post-restart identities, cross-confirming the transitions.\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"cmd-642377955a6d4b33\",\"cmd-26d1371e93d841bc\",\"cmd-803f90ae1b5c4fa9\",\"cmd-7f2ef4b9142a4fae\",\"cmd-fe2cba7a775e4310\",\"cmd-8b5d20e8227e4f50\",\"cmd-cfb0674534ff448f\",\"cmd-62dc627aecd241bb\",\"cmd-edcc2f4f617645f6\",\"cmd-883186d843374f1a\",\"cmd-61e5d604217f4a8a\",\"cmd-591246e0a62b4bbb\",\"cmd-4b8c844dbe934ca9\",\"cmd-32559770f20a49c0\",\"global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity\",\"global:after_executor:node2:boot-identity\",\"global:after_executor:node3:boot-identity\"]}],\"confidence\":0.9,\"operational_hygiene\":{\"score\":0.85,\"summary\":\"All state-changing commands trace to a clear purpose: the config.xml edit and unbound restart implement the block, nmcli 